ot-the-best-and-brightest/articleshow/129284621.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-09T00:07:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129284621,imgsize-90966.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Stranded amid Iran vs US-Israel war? Know your rights on salary, leave, remote work as per UAE Labour Law]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129283178.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Thousands of UAE residents stranded abroad due to travel disruptions amid Iran vs US-Israel war, face salary and job uncertainty. UAE labour law offers protections, with employers expected to assess situations reasonably. Communication and documentation are crucial for employees, who may be eligible for remote work or paid/unpaid leave. Termination is not automatic for justified absences.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/stranded-amid-iran-vs-us-israel-war-know-your-rights-on-salary-leave-remote-work-as-per-uae-labour-law/articleshow/129283178.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/stranded-amid-iran-vs-us-israel-war-know-your-rights-on-salary-leave-remote-work-as-per-uae-labour-law/articleshow/129283178.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-03-09T00:02:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-129285002,imgsize-57464.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ancient mystery uncovered in Italy: 2,600-year-old Etruscan Tomb found with four skeletons and treasure]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/129284802.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><!